WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
Whether you have come from north or south, east or west,

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:07.880
near or far, every leader in this beautiful hall

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.680
today represents a rich culture, a noble history,

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.520
and a proud heritage that makes each nation majestic

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.459
and unique, unlike anything else in human history

00:00:19.459 --> 00:00:23.260
or any other place on the face of the Earth.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.620
From London to Lima, from Rome to Athens,

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:31.820
from Paris to Seoul, from Cairo to Tokyo and Amsterdam,

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:35.660
to right here in New York City, we stand on the shoulders

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.500
of the leaders and legends, generals and giants,

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.840
heroes and titans who won and built our beloved nations,

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.439
all of our nations.

